cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Mera.jl in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Mera.jl: Fast, conservation-correct analysis of RAMSES adaptive-mesh-refinement simulations in Julia"
abstract: >-
  Mera.jl is a Julia package for reading and analysing RAMSES adaptive-mesh-refinement simulation
  output (hydro, gravity, particles, clumps, radiative transfer). It provides spatial selection,
  a derived-quantity registry with physical units, weighted profiles and phase diagrams,
  mass-conserving projections and covering grids, a pluggable structure (clump/halo) finder, and
  a conservation-correct inflow/outflow flux-budget tool, all checked by a data-free correctness oracle.
type: software
